  "notes": "连接引导更清晰，恢复更稳。\n\n- 首页显示首次连接的下一步指引及连接恢复状态。\n- 自动切换线路保持可选，尊重手动选择；线路恢复正常后取消等待中的自动切换。\n- 优化节点列表、分组操作和设置页布局。\n- 补充连接生命周期、请求超时和客户端配置回归测试。\n",
  "notesEn": "Clearer guidance and steadier recovery.\n\n- Home shows the next step for a first connection and its recovery status.\n- Automatic line switching remains optional, respects manual choices, and cancels pending switches when the line recovers.\n- Improve node lists, group controls and settings layouts.\n- Add regression coverage for connection lifecycles, request deadlines and client configuration.\n",
